OL,3,GNEWSAData centre site owners ordered to
OL,4,Arestore farmland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of land earmarked for a
OL,7,Fproposed data centre is facing action
OL,8,Fover failing to restore the site to its
OL,9,Foriginal state.
OL,11,FLand off Millington Road near Little
OL,12,FBollington, near Lymm, Cheshire, was
OL,13,Fused as a compound for vehicles working
OL,14,Fon upgrades to nearby motorways, and
OL,15,Fnow forms part of a site on which a
OL,16,Ftech firm wants to build a large data
OL,17,Fcentre compound.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
