OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAData centre site owners ordered to
OL,4,Arestore farmland
OL,5,
OL,6,FCheshire East Council said the
OL,7,Fenforcement notice against the Tatton
OL,8,FEstate was not linked to the data
OL,9,Fcentre plan, but campaigners against
OL,10,Fthe 60-acre facility hope the council
OL,11,Faction will make it more difficult for
OL,12,Fthe proposals to get planning
OL,13,Fpermission.
OL,15,FTatton Estate said it was appealing
OL,16,Fagainst the enforcement notice.
